    "blurb": "Send and track DocuSeal e-signature requests",
    "overview": "Send documents for e-signature and manage DocuSeal templates and submissions directly from your Camunda processes. React instantly to signing events with the built-in inbound Form Webhook connector, no custom code required.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Send, sign, and track documents without leaving Camunda",
    "splashDescription": "The DocuSeal Connector brings e-signature capabilities directly into your Camunda processes. Create signature requests from existing templates or from PDF, DOCX, and HTML files, send them to one or more signers by email, and track submissions and submitters as they progress. Retrieve signed documents automatically once a submission is complete, and manage your DocuSeal templates, including cloning, merging, and archiving, without leaving the Modeler. An inbound Form Webhook connector complements the outbound operations, letting your process react in real time to form.viewed, form.started, form.completed, and form.declined events, with correlation and output mapping pre-wired to the outbound connector's submission ID. Together, they let you build end-to-end contract and consent processes, from sending a document for signature to reacting the moment it's signed, entirely with no-code connectors on top of the native HTTP and Webhook connectors.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/830625/overview/img15368840474659689352.png?62e1fff6ed5cec8840f9e9bf42f9eb70",
